#====================================================================
# DRAFT-cute_png-1.0.0-delivery-preview-state-continuation - delivery
# preview requires human approval; report must keep the SAME task_id
# active snapshot with preview status, never terminal/completed semantics
#====================================================================

id:                     E1721
trigger_tool:           oh-executor|http|tasks|approve|delivery_preview|awaiting_user_approval|stale_delivery_approval_rejected|active-tasks
phase:                  ci|delivery|approval|preview

error_signature:        stale_delivery_approval_rejected|409.*stale|delivery_approval_required.*true|delivery_preview_awaiting_approval|terminal.*true.*preview|active-tasks.*not.*exist

severity:               3
category:               ohos, approval, delivery
match_keywords:         delivery preview, delivery_preview, awaiting_user_approval, stale_delivery_approval_rejected, approve, active-tasks, task_id, terminal, receipt, continuation, 交付预览, 审批

title:                  人工批准的本地 delivery preview 不是最终业务结果：必须保持同一 task_id 活动快照并以 preview 状态回报；以 completed/terminal 提交会导致审视快照清理、/approve 返回 409 stale

root_cause:             |
  delivery_approval_required: true 的任务要求先发 delivery preview 供人工批准。执行端若把 preview
  以 completed/terminal 语义提交，服务生成终态 receipt 并清理 active-tasks/<lib>.json 活动快照，
  后续 /approve 因找不到活动任务返回 409 stale_delivery_approval_rejected；同 task_id 无法续跑。
  业务字段 status=delivery_preview_awaiting_approval + terminal=false 与 receipt terminal=true
  的两层语义不一致是问题样本，执行端不得自行修复（禁伪造 receipt / 改控制器状态 / 绕过批准）。

verification_cmd:       curl -sS POST http://192.168.31.248:8080/tasks/<lib>/result -d @preview.json ; curl -sS GET http://192.168.31.248:8080/tasks/<lib> ; curl -sS POST http://192.168.31.248:8080/tasks/<lib>/approve

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           keep-active-snapshot-preview-status-then-approve-continue
rec_description:        预览回报用 preview 状态（terminal=false）+ 完整字段，保持同一 task_id 活动快照；
                         批准后同 task_id 续跑远端写入；绝不把 preview 当作终态提交。

rec_command:            <report preview with status=delivery_preview_awaiting_approval, terminal=false> && <await approval> && <execute authorized remote writes under same task_id>

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      report-preview-state-only
fallback_description:   若服务不接受 preview 语义回报，保持任务活动并如实回报协议缺失/拒绝证据，
                         不创建终态 receipt、不伪造批准、不自行修复控制器状态。

rec_auto_fix:           true
rec_impl:               delivery-preview-state-continuation

forbid_1_pattern:        把 preview 以 completed/terminal 语义提交|伪造 receipt|直接改 active-task/approval
forbid_1_reason:         终态 receipt 清理活动快照导致 /approve stale 拒绝，且绕过人工批准
forbid_1_consequence:    409 stale_delivery_approval_rejected；同 task_id 无法续跑；违反交付治理

principles:

doc_file:               knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-cute_png-1.0.0-delivery-preview-state-continuation.md
last_updated:           2026-08-31
source_event:           cute_png 1.0.0 R05 path_a_local_delivery_preview (pc1-71): 业务字段
                        status=delivery_preview_awaiting_approval/terminal=false，receipt 却记
                        terminal=true，active-tasks/cute_png.json 不存在，POST /approve →
                        409 stale_delivery_approval_rejected
authors:                pc1-71
source_pr:
metrics_success_count:  0
metrics_fail_count:     1
metrics_confidence:     0.8
metrics_last_used:      2026-08-31
affected_scope:         人工批准的本地 delivery preview 不是最终业务结果：必须保持同一 task_id 活动快照并以 prev
